## Bundle Protocol configuration for heterogeneous test - Node 3 (CBR enabled)
## Using UDP CLA

1
m custodymode orangebook
a scheme ipn 'ipnfw' 'ipnadminep'
a endpoint ipn:3.0 x
a endpoint ipn:3.1 x
a endpoint ipn:3.2 x
a protocol udp 1400 100
a induct udp 127.0.0.1:4563 udpcli
a outduct udp 127.0.0.1:4562 udpclo
r 'ipnadmin node.ipnrc'
s
